{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:74546ea469cc6d78e0a11f0876ba93efed024cb0714c12b98a9e30c0c4c7d4bd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0851405f447665eeb814940ff85c8ebf3cc42342556229bb0286073d32875de3",
      "text": "怎么样，秀。这首歌？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a39c9bf72930092f30a37f406873777a52fe61fa8b7a3e930a5372f473d9d146",
      "text": "嘿，挺不错的嘛。\n特别是副歌部分，朗朗上口很容易记住。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78994357eb8588c5ebae084d2d3245b40901e14b3b0180370e398d3be3de50a4",
      "text": "对吧？这个网站有很多好歌，\n我觉得你肯定会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a09a035e873aa20c916775797099ee67671ecb73f3138afdaea08ae97d76056",
      "text": "（……确实不算差，不过）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ff9592eab13d44bd3402e6968994e1896e573983c59ae1ebe1d99cee52b8cdb",
      "text": "（要是我的话，会把调再升一点，\n把主旋律给突出来……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:524ff1df66e23777f202c4b1e70b9f899f3a59e49956922b571c6064cedb5d23",
      "text": "（这个……要是我的话，是不是能做出\n更好的东西来？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000066:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99f2b6c56cc16ed337dbedd63833ea552f8f5130c26879371829d5761e5559ff",
      "text": "喂。来听一下这个看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c62530f7f27e15a7e8fd6a08e68b89397c03ede5a0cce53a770d5d98ce75b4c",
      "text": "……喂，这是谁的歌啊？\n挖到很厉害的东西了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db181fec841aaec6b2674f348c9c6077356236e8896f2ac55d13237880f996bf",
      "text": "哼，是我哦。……怎么样？\n是不是想说点别的感想了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:426bb51f394463031027783bb7f47dbb9bf7362c9deff6092494e94709d7a91b",
      "text": "太吃惊了……\n没想到你连这种才能都有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daf76cdd54830ec90df5fac0b3c80b9139bdb3039442f25b393d72eb514aaff6",
      "text": "对吧？乐坛新星降临了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
